{"version":1,"content":"<p>音樂團隊「鸞鳳鳴」成員、內地知名古風歌手吾恩，昨日（30日）凌晨不敵病魔逝世，終年41歲。</p><p>其伴侶於31日悲痛發文證實：「小夥伴們，吾恩昨晚凌晨走了。</p><p>」消息一出隨即登頂熱搜，眾多歌迷紛紛留言悼念。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.395490+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T03:13:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"faa52f8e2f8443d656c7c190faae0b92f51c34bb7ab7e2fa627e5335cfac0c3b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}